ass="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-4 sm:px-6"><p class="mb-6 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#09090b]/40 sm:text-xs" style="opacity:0">[04] You approve, it goes out</p><h2 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-frank-ruhl-libre)] mb-4 max-w-[760px] text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[#09090b] sm:text-4xl md:text-[44px]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)">A couple of minutes a day, and the week is filled.</h2><div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-7" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#FE7BCD] bg-[#FEF0F7]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4 text-[#D64A9E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-[#09090b] sm:text-base">The queue fills itself</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#71717a]">New drafts land every week off what is breaking out right then. You open a short review queue, not an empty editor.</p></div><div class="border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-7" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#FE7BCD] bg-[#FEF0F7]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen-line h-4 w-4 text-[#D64A9E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 21h8"></path><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-[#09090b] sm:text-base">Approve, edit or skip</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#71717a]">Keep the ones you like, rewrite a line, or skip it. Skipping teaches it what you would never post - the next batch moves.</p></div><div class="border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-7" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#FE7BCD] bg-[#FEF0F7]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-check h-4 w-4 text-[#D64A9E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path><path d="m9 16 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-[#09090b] sm:text-base">The calendar takes it from there</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#71717a]">An approved post claims the next open slot. Post it yourself, or connect the account and let Origami publish it on schedule.</p></div></div><p class="mt-8 flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#71717a]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#D64A9E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>Nothing goes out until you approve it. Publishing is manual unless you connect an account and switch it on.</p></div></section><section class="w-full bg-white pb-20 pt-4 md:pb-28"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-4 sm:px-6"><p class="mb-6 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#09090b]/40 sm:text-xs" style="opacity:0">[05] Why it works</p><h2 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-frank-ruhl-libre)] mb-4 max-w-[760px] text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[#09090b] sm:text-4xl md:text-[44px]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)">Proven, not guessed.</h2><div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#d4d4d8] hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] sm:p-8" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="mb-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-[#09090b] sm:text-base">Scored by outlier, not by likes</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#71717a]">Every candidate is ranked by how far it beat its own author&#x27;s baseline, so you model formats that genuinely broke out instead of posts from accounts that always go big.</p></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#d4d4d8] hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] sm:p-8" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="mb-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-[#09090b] sm:text-base">Sounds like you, not like AI</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#71717a]">Drafts are written from your own material and your own voice, so they keep your tone and point of view rather than the flat register everyone recognises by now.</p></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#d4d4d8] hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] sm:p-8" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="mb-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-[#09090b] sm:text-base">Words and artwork together</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#71717a]">The image is generated for the post it ships with, on your brand kit. No stock photography, no hunting for a graphic at posting time.</p></div><div class="group flex flex-col border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#d4d4d8] hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] sm:p-8" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="mb-2 text-[15px] font-medium text-[#09090b] sm:text-base">You stay in control</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#71717a]">You approve every post. Publishing is manual by default, and automatic only for the accounts you connect and switch on yourself.</p></div></div></div></section></main><section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white w-full relative overflow-hidden"><div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-6 text-left"><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-[-0.5px] text-[#09090b] mb-4">Find your next perfect customers.</h2><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#09090b]/50 mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">Join teams who are already using AI to build pipeline faster. Start your free trial today.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><a href="/sign-up" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-9 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-[#D64A9E] bg-[#FEF0F7] border border-[#FE7BCD] hover:bg-[#FDDEED] hover:border-[#D64A9E] transition-all duration-150">Start Free</a><a href="https://calendly.com/d/cxyb-p4r-qwg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-9 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-[#09090b] bg-white border border-[#e4e4e7] shadow-[0_1px_2px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] hover:bg-[#f4f4f5] hover:text-[#18181b] transition-all duration-150">Request a Demo</a></div></div></section><footer id="resources" class="w-full bg-white relative overflow-hidden">